Prior art
---------
The design of cheap-eyes draws on ideas from the following MIT-licensed
projects. cheap-eyes is written from scratch; no source code from them is
included. If that ever changes, the copied files and their original MIT
notices will be listed here.

- claude-worker-delegation
  https://github.com/BardyLaw/claude-worker-delegation
  Ideas: the server reads files by path, short preview, usage log,
  daily budget, PreToolUse hook.

- claude-opencode-delegate
  https://github.com/aashahin/claude-opencode-delegate
  Ideas: async task registry, compact status header.
